{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|$Cutthroat Cuirass}}

{{PAGENAME}} is a high-tier piece of chest [[:Category:Armor|armor]] made from [[Hardened Leather|Hardened Leather]] and [[String]]. It is useful for those without access to [[:Category:Metal Bar|metal]], or those who wish to avoid the high [[Agility]] penalties imposed by other chest pieces such as [[Bronze Plate|Bronze Plate]]s and [[Plate Armor|Plate Armor]]. It equips to the [[Equipment Screen|equipment slot]] 4R.

==Quality Formula==

The quality formula is <math>\frac{_{q}Hardened Leather + _{q}String}{2}</math> [[softcap]]ped by <math>\sqrt{Sewing * Dexterity}</math>.

